xpectation changes: 'lift the sighting cap' now expects [covered, sighting] for two same-type requests (it was [sighting, sighting]). The property scenario seed 15 became seed 27, because the keyed draws changed the random paths and seed 27 reaches a several-type message. outcome:covered was added to EXERCISED.",
